{"ep": "14", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:02.41", "end": "0:00:07.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有什么东西怪怪的  我不知为啥有这种感觉"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 1, "start": "0:00:09.55", "end": "0:00:14.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "电视中正在播放的  是跟我一点关系都没有的同县选手的比赛"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 2, "start": "0:00:14.53", "end": "0:00:17.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥我正支持着正处于落后的一方"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 3, "start": "0:00:18.17", "end": "0:00:22.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后又不知为啥觉得差不多春日要搞点事出来了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 4, "start": "0:00:27.38", "end": "0:00:28.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  电话"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 5, "start": "0:00:28.89", "end": "0:00:30.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用你说我也知道"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 6, "start": "0:00:33.79", "end": "0:00:35.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你今天很闲吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 7, "start": "0:00:35.41", "end": "0:00:38.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "两点整全员在车站前集合  老老实实地过来哦"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 8, "start": "0:00:40.06", "end": "0:00:42.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我连一句话都没说上"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 9, "start": "0:00:43.96", "end": "0:00:45.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  电话"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 10, "start": "0:00:45.22", "end": "0:00:45.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我知道啦"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 11, "start": "0:00:47.22", "end": "0:00:47.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 12, "start": "0:00:47.89", "end": "0:00:49.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "忘跟你说带东西来了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 13, "start": "0:00:49.66", "end": "0:00:52.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一套泳装  还有足够的钱"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 14, "start": "0:00:52.65", "end": "0:00:55.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后一定要骑自行车来  Over～"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 15, "start": "0:00:56.11", "end": "0:00:56.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啥啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 16, "start": "0:00:59.74", "end": "0:01:02.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我好像又知道春日打算要说啥"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 17, "start": "0:01:04.24", "end": "0:01:05.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  不对"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 18, "start": "0:01:06.33", "end": "0:01:09.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正确地说  是感觉之前好像出现过完全相同的事情"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 19, "start": "0:01:10.44", "end": "0:01:12.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是所谓的「既视感」么"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 20, "start": "0:01:36.94", "end": "0:01:38.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "太慢了  阿虚！"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 21, "start": "0:01:38.31", "end": "0:01:39.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "多拿点干劲出来！"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 22, "start": "0:01:39.95", "end": "0:01:40.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是是"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 23, "start": "0:01:41.31", "end": "0:01:42.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让你们久等真抱歉"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 24, "start": "0:01:42.93", "end": "0:01:44.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也才刚到"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 25, "start": "0:01:45.04", "end": "0:01:47.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  全都到齐了  出发吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 26, "start": "0:01:48.00", "end": "0:01:48.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去哪里？"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 27, "start": "0:01:48.89", "end": "0:01:50.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然是去市民游泳池啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 28, "start": "0:01:51.10", "end": "0:01:52.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唉  说的也是"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 29, "start": "0:01:53.17", "end": "0:01:57.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夏天要有夏天的样子  不能不做有夏天特色的事情"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 30, "start": "0:01:57.75", "end": "0:02:00.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "失去的时间可是一去不返的啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 31, "start": "0:02:01.09", "end": "0:02:02.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以现在就要行动"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 32, "start": "0:02:02.94", "end": "0:02:05.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在这个只有一次的高一的暑假里"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 33, "start": "0:02:07.27", "end": "0:02:09.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺便我们是用自行车去泳池"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 34, "start": "0:02:10.80", "end": "0:02:12.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们也骑来了么"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 35, "start": "0:02:12.87", "end": "0:02:15.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "自行车只有你和我的两辆"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 36, "start": "0:02:16.86", "end": "0:02:18.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来  准备好了么？"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 37, "start": "0:02:19.01", "end": "0:02:20.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有什么可能好了！"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 38, "start": "0:02:20.30", "end": "0:02:21.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了哦"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 39, "start": "0:02:21.91", "end": "0:02:24.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  可不能输给古泉哦"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 40, "start": "0:02:25.38", "end": "0:02:26.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "立即出发！"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 41, "start": "0:02:28.01", "end": "0:02:28.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可恶…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 42, "start": "0:04:04.71", "end": "0:04:08.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  接下来是要玩啊  你怎么就筋疲力尽了？"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 43, "start": "0:04:08.90", "end": "0:04:09.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真不像样"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 44, "start": "0:04:10.03", "end": "0:04:11.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是谁的错啊  谁的啊！"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 45, "start": "0:04:14.80", "end": "0:04:18.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  这消毒液的气味  真给人一种实在的感觉啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 46, "start": "0:04:20.15", "end": "0:04:23.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之  来游泳吧  比赛哦"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 47, "start": "0:04:28.85", "end": "0:04:30.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙就读不懂这个么"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 48, "start": "0:04:30.99", "end": "0:04:34.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "赶紧过来  水温温的很舒服哦"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 49, "start": "0:04:36.20", "end": "0:04:37.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看起来挺欢乐的嘛"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 50, "start": "0:04:37.80", "end": "0:04:39.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是很欢乐的情景"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 51, "start": "0:04:40.02", "end": "0:04:45.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不觉得  凉宫同学也学会了有常识性的娱乐方法了么"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 52, "start": "0:04:45.94", "end": "0:04:52.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "笑得那么开心的凉宫同学  是不会做什么震动这个世界的事情的"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 53, "start": "0:04:54.62", "end": "0:04:55.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果真是那样就好了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 54, "start": "0:04:56.92", "end": "0:04:57.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 55, "start": "0:04:59.40", "end": "0:04:59.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了？"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 56, "start": "0:05:02.61", "end": "0:05:03.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉！"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 57, "start": "0:05:04.71", "end": "0:05:07.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  大概是我的错觉吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 58, "start": "0:05:07.78", "end": "0:05:12.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "初春以来发生了种种事情的缘故  只是变得有点神经质了吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 59, "start": "0:05:13.55", "end": "0:05:15.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我们也去游吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 60, "start": "0:05:19.13", "end": "0:05:19.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 61, "start": "0:05:32.58", "end": "0:05:33.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 62, "start": "0:05:33.76", "end": "0:05:38.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "与其说是市民泳池  倒是个更适合平民泳池这名字的地方"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 63, "start": "0:05:45.04", "end": "0:05:45.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这种感觉"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 64, "start": "0:05:48.88", "end": "0:05:50.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "觉得这种景象以前也见到过"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 65, "start": "0:05:52.45", "end": "0:05:56.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥觉得长门好像有些无聊的样子  在那里…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 66, "start": "0:05:56.46", "end": "0:05:56.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 67, "start": "0:05:57.75", "end": "0:06:00.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没错  然后春日跑来  说了这样的话"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 68, "start": "0:06:01.38", "end": "0:06:03.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这两个就是我的团员"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 69, "start": "0:06:03.31", "end": "0:06:05.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说什么他们都会听的  所以随便吩咐吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 70, "start": "0:06:07.45", "end": "0:06:08.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来  要玩了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 71, "start": "0:06:09.10", "end": "0:06:10.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来玩水中足球吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 72, "start": "0:06:10.74", "end": "0:06:11.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "过来吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 73, "start": "0:06:11.84", "end": "0:06:13.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之  这种事也常有"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 74, "start": "0:06:13.48", "end": "0:06:14.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既视感什么的"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 75, "start": "0:06:14.40", "end": "0:06:15.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来了哦  实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 76, "start": "0:06:16.08", "end": "0:06:16.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好～"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 77, "start": "0:06:17.52", "end": "0:06:18.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 78, "start": "0:06:20.64", "end": "0:06:21.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "抱歉"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 79, "start": "0:06:23.91", "end": "0:06:24.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是啥"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 80, "start": "0:06:25.56", "end": "0:06:28.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我试着考虑了下今后的活动计划"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 81, "start": "0:06:28.84", "end": "0:06:32.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要怎样来度过已经所剩无几的暑假的计划表"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 82, "start": "0:06:32.86", "end": "0:06:35.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "暑假只剩下两周了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 83, "start": "0:06:36.44", "end": "0:06:41.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "觉得还有很多事情没做呢  但时间却只剩那么一点"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 84, "start": "0:06:42.24", "end": "0:06:44.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以听好了  接下来要一起都做完哦"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 85, "start": "0:06:45.24", "end": "0:06:47.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠有什么想要做的事情么"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 86, "start": "0:06:47.94", "end": "0:06:51.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…我想捞金鱼"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 87, "start": "0:06:51.82", "end": "0:06:55.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "OK  捞金鱼"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 88, "start": "0:06:56.50", "end": "0:06:57.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不好意思  我看下"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 89, "start": "0:07:01.81", "end": "0:07:02.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 90, "start": "0:07:04.12", "end": "0:07:06.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呐  这附近什么地方有盂兰盆会么"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 91, "start": "0:07:07.22", "end": "0:07:08.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有烟花汇演也可以"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 92, "start": "0:07:09.50", "end": "0:07:10.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我去查吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 93, "start": "0:07:11.68", "end": "0:07:13.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "别忘了捞金鱼哦"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 94, "start": "0:07:13.62", "end": "0:07:15.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这可是实玖瑠的强烈要求哦"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 95, "start": "0:07:16.10", "end": "0:07:17.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "了解"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 96, "start": "0:07:18.27", "end": "0:07:20.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么阿虚  明天开始实行"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 97, "start": "0:07:24.23", "end": "0:07:26.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（来电  凉宫春日）"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 98, "start": "0:07:27.06", "end": "0:07:31.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天早晨  将我的懒觉夺走的又是春日"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 99, "start": "0:07:33.98", "end": "0:07:35.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "似乎是说找到盂兰盆会的会场了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 100, "start": "0:07:35.87", "end": "0:07:38.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今晚  地点是市民运动场…的样子"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 101, "start": "0:07:39.75", "end": "0:07:43.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可是  实玖瑠和有希都说没有"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 102, "start": "0:07:43.46", "end": "0:07:46.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以接下来去买今晚要穿的浴衣"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 103, "start": "0:07:46.63", "end": "0:07:50.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也没有  又找到了买一整套的话就会便宜的店"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 104, "start": "0:07:50.61", "end": "0:07:51.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你也陪着来吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 105, "start": "0:07:54.48", "end": "0:07:56.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日进了女装的大卖场之后"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 106, "start": "0:07:57.36", "end": "0:07:59.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "擅自为朝比奈学姐和长门挑选了浴衣"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 107, "start": "0:08:00.19", "end": "0:08:02.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后毫不客气地冲进了试衣间"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 108, "start": "0:08:02.99", "end": "0:08:04.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之后我们等了大约一小时"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 109, "start": "0:08:05.05", "end": "0:08:05.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我都伸懒腰了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 110, "start": "0:08:06.16", "end": "0:08:07.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "三个人终于都出来了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 111, "start": "0:08:09.49", "end": "0:08:10.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "Excellent！"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 112, "start": "0:08:11.18", "end": "0:08:12.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位  都非常合适哦"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 113, "start": "0:08:13.53", "end": "0:08:15.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然啦  是我给挑选的嘛"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 114, "start": "0:08:16.30", "end": "0:08:17.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "特别是实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 115, "start": "0:08:19.08", "end": "0:08:22.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好可爱  真不愧是我挑的"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 116, "start": "0:08:22.80", "end": "0:08:23.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是…是"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 117, "start": "0:08:24.16", "end": "0:08:26.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐  好棒  朝比奈学姐"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 118, "start": "0:08:32.40", "end": "0:08:34.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真亏得能聚集起这么多人啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 119, "start": "0:08:36.85", "end": "0:08:37.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 120, "start": "0:08:37.85", "end": "0:08:39.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又来了  这种感觉"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 121, "start": "0:08:42.06", "end": "0:08:45.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明明应该是很久没来了  却觉得最近就来过"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 122, "start": "0:08:46.72", "end": "0:08:47.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个楼塔"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 123, "start": "0:08:47.89", "end": "0:08:48.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个摊子"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 124, "start": "0:08:49.42", "end": "0:08:49.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 125, "start": "0:08:50.24", "end": "0:08:50.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 126, "start": "0:08:52.26", "end": "0:08:55.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那边有你想要玩的捞金鱼哦"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 127, "start": "0:08:55.56", "end": "0:08:56.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这边这边！"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 128, "start": "0:08:57.86", "end": "0:08:58.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好～"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 129, "start": "0:08:59.24", "end": "0:09:01.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们也去玩吧  如何"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 130, "start": "0:09:02.08", "end": "0:09:03.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "算了吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 131, "start": "0:09:13.96", "end": "0:09:16.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你对那种东西有兴趣么"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 132, "start": "0:09:20.85", "end": "0:09:22.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哪个？我给你买"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 133, "start": "0:09:22.33", "end": "0:09:22.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 134, "start": "0:09:23.87", "end": "0:09:24.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 135, "start": "0:09:24.57", "end": "0:09:25.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好的"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 136, "start": "0:09:28.60", "end": "0:09:30.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥有种受她照顾的感觉"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 137, "start": "0:09:31.40", "end": "0:09:33.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种东西由我来买就好了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 138, "start": "0:09:36.69", "end": "0:09:40.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎呀  大丰收啊大丰收  十三条"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 139, "start": "0:09:40.74", "end": "0:09:44.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但我不需要那么多  就和实玖瑠一人只要了一条"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 140, "start": "0:09:46.59", "end": "0:09:49.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦  有希  你那面具哪里搞来的"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 141, "start": "0:09:50.29", "end": "0:09:50.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "买的"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 142, "start": "0:09:52.22", "end": "0:09:52.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是么"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 143, "start": "0:09:56.17", "end": "0:09:57.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你的背借我用下"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 144, "start": "0:09:57.74", "end": "0:09:58.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哈？"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 145, "start": "0:09:58.40", "end": "0:09:59.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了啦  转过去"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 146, "start": "0:10:00.29", "end": "0:10:01.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  你…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 147, "start": "0:10:02.30", "end": "0:10:04.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好  接下来玩烟花吧  烟花"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 148, "start": "0:10:05.09", "end": "0:10:06.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天就一起做了吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 149, "start": "0:10:07.93", "end": "0:10:10.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知道「吃饭只吃八分饱」这俗语吗  你这家伙"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 150, "start": "0:10:13.58", "end": "0:10:16.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在是夏天  在暑假中"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 151, "start": "0:10:17.36", "end": "0:10:19.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以  虽然极力想要忘记"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 152, "start": "0:10:20.36", "end": "0:10:22.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但有件事情却让我很在意"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 153, "start": "0:10:26.44", "end": "0:10:29.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么各位  明天是捉昆虫哦"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 154, "start": "0:10:29.71", "end": "0:10:32.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这就是SOS团内部的捉蝉大战哦"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 155, "start": "0:10:32.55", "end": "0:10:37.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "捉到的虫子最多的那个人  就把团长的权力让给他一天！"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 156, "start": "0:10:38.36", "end": "0:10:41.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日啊  虽说玩也没问题  你暑假作业做完了么"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 157, "start": "0:10:44.07", "end": "0:10:48.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你说什么啊  那样的作业有三天不就全部做完了吗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 158, "start": "0:10:49.10", "end": "0:10:55.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种麻烦事就得事先赶紧收拾掉  再毫无后顾之忧地玩到爽"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 159, "start": "0:10:55.65", "end": "0:10:58.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这才是正确的享受暑假的方法"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 160, "start": "0:11:00.04", "end": "0:11:02.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么这种家伙脑子这么好"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 161, "start": "0:11:04.08", "end": "0:11:07.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天  是个让人有种「连这也是啊」的感觉的大晴天"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 162, "start": "0:11:08.12", "end": "0:11:11.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "SOS团内部的捉蝉大战  就在这样的天气中举办了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 163, "start": "0:11:12.58", "end": "0:11:14.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各人都以自己的方式进行了奋斗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 164, "start": "0:11:15.26", "end": "0:11:19.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "应该说不出所料还是说啥呢  获胜者是春日"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 165, "start": "0:11:22.03", "end": "0:11:25.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天  我们在还没搞清状况的状态下就被召集了起来"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 166, "start": "0:11:26.14", "end": "0:11:29.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在同样一无所知的情况下被套上了青蛙的罩衣"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 167, "start": "0:11:29.92", "end": "0:11:33.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "开始在超市的门口发气球的兼职"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 168, "start": "0:11:36.73", "end": "0:11:37.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没事吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 169, "start": "0:11:38.00", "end": "0:11:40.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  还以为要死了  不如说就死了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 170, "start": "0:11:40.23", "end": "0:11:43.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位辛苦了  这么热的天真是辛苦你们了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 171, "start": "0:11:43.49", "end": "0:11:45.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "店长大叔也谢谢大家了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 172, "start": "0:11:46.11", "end": "0:11:47.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我才不要大叔的感谢"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 173, "start": "0:11:48.12", "end": "0:11:48.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "工钱呢"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 174, "start": "0:11:49.55", "end": "0:11:50.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个咯"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 175, "start": "0:11:50.71", "end": "0:11:52.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我很早之前就很想要的了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 176, "start": "0:11:53.04", "end": "0:11:56.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大叔也看在实玖瑠的份上说送给我们当作工钱的"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 177, "start": "0:11:57.08", "end": "0:11:59.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们就为了这种东西…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 178, "start": "0:11:59.82", "end": "0:12:02.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  你想什么时候穿都可以哦"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 179, "start": "0:12:03.25", "end": "0:12:04.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我许可的"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 180, "start": "0:12:04.80", "end": "0:12:05.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呱呱…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 181, "start": "0:12:13.53", "end": "0:12:16.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那天晚上  夺去了我的安眠的"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 182, "start": "0:12:17.10", "end": "0:12:19.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又是一个电话"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 183, "start": "0:12:21.01", "end": "0:12:21.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可恶"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 184, "start": "0:12:25.77", "end": "0:12:26.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你好"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 185, "start": "0:12:29.78", "end": "0:12:31.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 186, "start": "0:12:35.04", "end": "0:12:36.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难道说是朝比奈学姐？"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 187, "start": "0:12:36.73", "end": "0:12:38.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是  是我"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 188, "start": "0:12:39.81", "end": "0:12:44.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有非常不好的事情…这样下去我…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 189, "start": "0:12:45.61", "end": "0:12:46.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 190, "start": "0:12:46.06", "end": "0:12:47.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你好  我是古泉"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 191, "start": "0:12:48.19", "end": "0:12:50.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你怎么会跟朝比奈学姐在一起"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 192, "start": "0:12:50.61", "end": "0:12:54.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为有点情况  你能现在就过来么"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 193, "start": "0:12:54.96", "end": "0:12:56.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还用问么！我马上就去！"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 194, "start": "0:13:16.50", "end": "0:13:17.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 195, "start": "0:13:17.57", "end": "0:13:18.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "究竟怎么了？"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 196, "start": "0:13:19.86", "end": "0:13:21.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  我…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 197, "start": "0:13:22.09", "end": "0:13:24.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我回不了未来了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 198, "start": "0:13:28.33", "end": "0:13:29.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "回不去了？"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 199, "start": "0:13:29.72", "end": "0:13:31.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你说回不去了  是…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 200, "start": "0:13:32.08", "end": "0:13:33.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说  事情是这样的"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 201, "start": "0:13:34.79", "end": "0:13:37.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们一直在重复同样的时间"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 202, "start": "0:13:38.81", "end": "0:13:40.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  什么？"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 203, "start": "0:13:40.49", "end": "0:13:43.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们一直在重复同样的时间"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 204, "start": "0:13:44.81", "end": "0:13:47.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们一直在重复同样的时间"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 205, "start": "0:13:47.36", "end": "0:13:50.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你知道自己在说什么吗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 206, "start": "0:13:50.62", "end": "0:13:54.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "知道  没有比现在更清楚的了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 207, "start": "0:13:54.62", "end": "0:13:56.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我刚才和朝比奈学姐谈了下"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 208, "start": "0:13:57.07", "end": "0:13:57.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒是叫上我啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 209, "start": "0:13:58.20", "end": "0:14:02.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后意识到最近这里时间的流动出现了异常"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 210, "start": "0:14:03.26", "end": "0:14:05.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这该说是朝比奈学姐的功绩吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 211, "start": "0:14:06.53", "end": "0:14:08.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "托她的福我也确信了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 212, "start": "0:14:09.17", "end": "0:14:09.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 213, "start": "0:14:10.31", "end": "0:14:16.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们正无数次重复体验同样的时间"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 214, "start": "0:14:17.41", "end": "0:14:18.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个刚才就听你说了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 215, "start": "0:14:19.06", "end": "0:14:23.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正确地说应该是八月十七日到三十一日之间"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 216, "start": "0:14:23.91", "end": "0:14:27.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们正处在这永无止境的暑假的正中间里"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 217, "start": "0:14:28.28", "end": "0:14:30.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  确实是无止境的状态呢"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 218, "start": "0:14:31.01", "end": "0:14:33.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这可是个不会完结的Endless Summer呢"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 219, "start": "0:14:34.16", "end": "0:14:39.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在这个世界里  九月一日之后的时间全部消失了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 220, "start": "0:14:39.85", "end": "0:14:42.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐无法回到未来也是因为这个"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 221, "start": "0:14:43.67", "end": "0:14:47.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "无法回到不存在的未来  这是理所当然的了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 222, "start": "0:14:47.82", "end": "0:14:51.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "够了  这么莫名其妙的话哪里理所当然了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 223, "start": "0:14:52.34", "end": "0:14:53.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要谁相信那个啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 224, "start": "0:14:55.83", "end": "0:14:58.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我希望至少你能相信"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 225, "start": "0:15:00.10", "end": "0:15:03.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…也由我来说明一下吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 226, "start": "0:15:04.29", "end": "0:15:04.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 227, "start": "0:15:06.88", "end": "0:15:14.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为禁止说明的事项  我一直在和未来联系和做禁止说明的事项"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 228, "start": "0:15:16.33", "end": "0:15:20.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一个礼拜左右没有禁止说明的事项了啊  有点奇怪啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 229, "start": "0:15:20.54", "end": "0:15:24.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我正这么想着  于是禁止说明的事项…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 230, "start": "0:15:25.33", "end": "0:15:30.31", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我吓了一大跳  慌张之下就做了禁止说明的事项…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 231, "start": "0:15:28.94", "end": "0:15:35.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐  难道说那个禁止说明的事项是放送禁止用语什么的吗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 232, "start": "0:15:30.61", "end": "0:15:32.41", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但也完全是禁止说明的事项…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 233, "start": "0:15:38.66", "end": "0:15:43.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那  我们被困在那个叫什么封闭空间里了吗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 234, "start": "0:15:44.49", "end": "0:15:45.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并不是这样"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 235, "start": "0:15:46.25", "end": "0:15:48.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是一部分的时间被分割开了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 236, "start": "0:15:49.81", "end": "0:15:53.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到八月三十一日二十四时整的那一瞬"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 237, "start": "0:15:53.69", "end": "0:15:57.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一切都被重置  再回到十七日的过程"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 238, "start": "0:15:58.37", "end": "0:15:58.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 239, "start": "0:15:59.47", "end": "0:16:01.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  全人类的记忆呢"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 240, "start": "0:16:01.59", "end": "0:16:05.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那些也会重置  会从头再来一次"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 241, "start": "0:16:06.83", "end": "0:16:09.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又是关于时间这个那个了的问题吗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 242, "start": "0:16:11.82", "end": "0:16:13.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唉  那也是没办法的事了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 243, "start": "0:16:14.06", "end": "0:16:16.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  这件事和朝比奈学姐没关系"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 244, "start": "0:16:17.66", "end": "0:16:18.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那原因是什么"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 245, "start": "0:16:19.45", "end": "0:16:20.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是凉宫同学吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 246, "start": "0:16:24.36", "end": "0:16:25.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然她本人没有意识到"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 247, "start": "0:16:26.46", "end": "0:16:30.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是心里什么地方总在想着暑假不要结束吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 248, "start": "0:16:30.88", "end": "0:16:33.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙还留有什么遗憾吗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 249, "start": "0:16:33.96", "end": "0:16:34.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也是这么想的"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 250, "start": "0:16:35.58", "end": "0:16:40.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许她是想着暑假还有什么事情剩下没做吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 251, "start": "0:16:41.84", "end": "0:16:45.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还真是个会把一些莫名其妙的事情\n展开到大宇宙规模的家伙啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 252, "start": "0:16:49.43", "end": "0:16:50.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从刚才开始我就有点在意"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 253, "start": "0:16:51.36", "end": "0:16:53.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你好像乐在其中呢"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 254, "start": "0:16:53.56", "end": "0:16:58.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为最近频繁发生的既视感之谜终于解开了嘛"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 255, "start": "0:16:58.71", "end": "0:17:03.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在想来  那只能理解为是由于记忆重置而散落下来的残渣吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 256, "start": "0:17:05.74", "end": "0:17:07.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你也察觉到了吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 257, "start": "0:17:10.17", "end": "0:17:12.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "全世界的人都感觉得到这个吗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 258, "start": "0:17:14.83", "end": "0:17:17.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我和你算是特例了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 259, "start": "0:17:17.79", "end": "0:17:22.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好像只有和凉宫同学亲近的人才能感觉到这份异样"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 260, "start": "0:17:23.06", "end": "0:17:24.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那春日怎么样"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 261, "start": "0:17:24.46", "end": "0:17:25.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙多少有一点意识到吗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 262, "start": "0:17:26.27", "end": "0:17:27.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一点都没有呢"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 263, "start": "0:17:28.42", "end": "0:17:31.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒不如说有了反而糟糕了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 264, "start": "0:17:33.19", "end": "0:17:35.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  别说是既视感了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 265, "start": "0:17:36.04", "end": "0:17:41.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我觉得应该有一个人保存着所有轮回中的记忆"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 266, "start": "0:17:43.68", "end": "0:17:45.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谁啊  那个人"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 267, "start": "0:17:46.09", "end": "0:17:47.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用说也该知道吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 268, "start": "0:17:51.07", "end": "0:17:52.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  是这样吗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 269, "start": "0:17:53.23", "end": "0:17:53.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 270, "start": "0:17:54.21", "end": "0:17:55.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你…全都记得吗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 271, "start": "0:17:56.10", "end": "0:17:56.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 272, "start": "0:17:58.78", "end": "0:18:02.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺带问下  到底重复几次了？"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 273, "start": "0:18:02.70", "end": "0:18:06.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次是第15499次"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 274, "start": "0:18:08.24", "end": "0:18:10.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15499？"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 275, "start": "0:18:11.37", "end": "0:18:13.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15499是啥啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 276, "start": "0:18:14.23", "end": "0:18:16.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  你在说啥啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 277, "start": "0:18:18.01", "end": "0:18:20.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你那话是认真的吗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 278, "start": "0:18:20.92", "end": "0:18:21.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 279, "start": "0:18:21.92", "end": "0:18:26.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么多的次数  我们全都在重复同样的事情吗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 280, "start": "0:18:26.74", "end": "0:18:28.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并非全部如此"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 281, "start": "0:18:28.75", "end": "0:18:37.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15499次中没有去盂兰盆会的模式  有第2391次和第11054次的这两次"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 282, "start": "0:18:37.70", "end": "0:18:42.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "另外  去了盂兰盆会而没有捞金鱼的模式有437次"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 283, "start": "0:18:43.23", "end": "0:18:48.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去打工的有9026次  其内容分成6个部分"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 284, "start": "0:18:48.46", "end": "0:18:53.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "除了发放气球  还有搬货物  收银  发送传单  接电话…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 285, "start": "0:18:53.67", "end": "0:18:55.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…我知道了  已经够了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 286, "start": "0:19:03.57", "end": "0:19:06.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第15499次"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 287, "start": "0:19:07.34", "end": "0:19:08.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门她这么说了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 288, "start": "0:19:09.44", "end": "0:19:11.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "乘上两周的话就是…唔…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 289, "start": "0:19:12.21", "end": "0:19:13.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "差不多是594年的时间了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 290, "start": "0:19:14.69", "end": "0:19:16.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么长的时间仅她一个人"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 291, "start": "0:19:16.66", "end": "0:19:20.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "能够好好地保留着记忆  无数次无数次地重复吗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 292, "start": "0:19:21.36", "end": "0:19:26.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  你到底到现在为止都以什么样的心情度过的啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 293, "start": "0:19:30.10", "end": "0:19:32.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我又听了荒唐的话了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 294, "start": "0:19:34.06", "end": "0:19:36.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天是观测天体"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 295, "start": "0:19:37.24", "end": "0:19:38.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "地点是长门公寓的楼顶"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 296, "start": "0:19:39.42", "end": "0:19:41.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "天体望远镜由古泉准备"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 297, "start": "0:19:43.03", "end": "0:19:46.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  我看够了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 298, "start": "0:19:46.99", "end": "0:19:48.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去找UFO吧  UFO"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 299, "start": "0:19:48.89", "end": "0:19:50.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  春日别…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 300, "start": "0:19:51.06", "end": "0:19:53.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  不要啊  要坏掉了…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 301, "start": "0:19:58.94", "end": "0:20:01.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这家伙到底想做啥啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 302, "start": "0:20:02.47", "end": "0:20:04.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是啊  是什么呢"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 303, "start": "0:20:05.10", "end": "0:20:07.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个能搞清楚的话问题也就迎刃而解了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 304, "start": "0:20:09.26", "end": "0:20:10.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "试下这样怎么样"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 305, "start": "0:20:11.62", "end": "0:20:13.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从后面突然抱住凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 306, "start": "0:20:14.39", "end": "0:20:17.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在她耳边轻语「I love you」"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 307, "start": "0:20:17.61", "end": "0:20:18.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这由谁来做啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 308, "start": "0:20:19.20", "end": "0:20:21.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "除了你没有适合的人了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 309, "start": "0:20:21.70", "end": "0:20:22.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我断然拒绝！"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 310, "start": "0:20:24.44", "end": "0:20:26.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我来做怎么样"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 311, "start": "0:20:31.26", "end": "0:20:34.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "开玩笑的了  我做这角色还不够格"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 312, "start": "0:20:35.55", "end": "0:20:38.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样只会让凉宫同学增加多余的混乱吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 313, "start": "0:20:41.21", "end": "0:20:45.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怒涛般的暑假活动消化体制还在继续"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 314, "start": "0:20:46.22", "end": "0:20:47.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们去了打击中心"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 315, "start": "0:20:48.56", "end": "0:20:50.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看了货真价实的烟花大会"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 316, "start": "0:20:50.88", "end": "0:20:52.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "参加了垂钓大会"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 317, "start": "0:20:53.11", "end": "0:20:55.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "另外还有试胆大会  看连场电影"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 318, "start": "0:20:56.37", "end": "0:20:57.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "海水浴  打保龄球"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 319, "start": "0:20:58.64", "end": "0:20:59.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "以及唱卡拉OK"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 320, "start": "0:21:00.10", "end": "0:21:02.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们一直在活动来活动去的"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 321, "start": "0:21:03.22", "end": "0:21:06.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然我不认为这样春日就会满足"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 322, "start": "0:21:07.49", "end": "0:21:10.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但即便如此也没有什么行动"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 323, "start": "0:21:10.46", "end": "0:21:14.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "即使如此暑假的日子也一天天减少着"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 324, "start": "0:21:15.01", "end": "0:21:19.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就这么过着  日子到了八月三十日"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 325, "start": "0:21:21.71", "end": "0:21:24.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样课题就如实地完成了呢"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 326, "start": "0:21:30.09", "end": "0:21:32.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样子好吗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 327, "start": "0:21:33.69", "end": "0:21:34.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 328, "start": "0:21:34.61", "end": "0:21:35.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就这样了呢"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 329, "start": "0:21:36.65", "end": "0:21:39.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  还有什么想做的吗"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 330, "start": "0:21:43.34", "end": "0:21:44.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "算了  差不多了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 331, "start": "0:21:44.72", "end": "0:21:48.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个暑假已经做了好多事了  已经很充实了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 332, "start": "0:21:48.72", "end": "0:21:53.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  春日  你应该还没有满足才对  你…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 333, "start": "0:21:55.18", "end": "0:21:56.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么今天就到此为止了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 334, "start": "0:21:57.16", "end": "0:22:00.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天当预备日先空下来了  大家就这样休息吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 335, "start": "0:22:01.30", "end": "0:22:03.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "后天再在社团教室再见吧"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 336, "start": "0:22:06.52", "end": "0:22:07.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等…等等  春日！"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 337, "start": "0:22:09.99", "end": "0:22:11.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又来了  这既视感"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 338, "start": "0:22:12.33", "end": "0:22:14.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且还前所未有地强烈"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 339, "start": "0:22:15.81", "end": "0:22:17.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不能就这样让春日回去"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 340, "start": "0:22:17.87", "end": "0:22:18.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让她回去的话"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 341, "start": "0:22:19.02", "end": "0:22:23.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那重复了一万几千次的两星期又要开始了"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 342, "start": "0:22:24.22", "end": "0:22:27.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  我该做什么呢  应该说什么呢"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 343, "start": "0:22:28.66", "end": "0:22:31.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在春日的话里应该有提示的"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 344, "start": "0:22:32.15", "end": "0:22:33.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但那是什么"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 345, "start": "0:22:34.22", "end": "0:22:36.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她至今都说了些什么"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 346, "start": "0:22:38.72", "end": "0:22:42.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我不明白  也想不到…"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 347, "start": "0:22:58.87", "end": "0:23:00.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "八月三十一日"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 348, "start": "0:23:01.34", "end": "0:23:02.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "作业  还没动过"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 349, "start": "0:23:05.19", "end": "0:23:07.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "管他呢  怎么都成"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 350, "start": "0:23:11.13", "end": "0:23:16.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果再重复的话  作业做了也没意义啊"}
{"ep": "14", "idx": 351, "start": "0:23:24.69", "end": "0:23:31.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不管明天来不来  到时候就交给那时的我算啦"}
